    <!-- Form View (စာကြောင်းတစ်ခုကိုနှိပ်ရင်) မှာ Tax နောက်မှာ ထည့်တာ -->
    <record id="view_order_form_inherit_fixed_discount" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">sale.order.form.fixed.discount</field>
        <field name="model">sale.order</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="sale.view_order_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr='//field[@name="order_line"]/list//field[@name="discount"]' position="after">
                <field name="fix_discount"
                       widget="monetary"
                       options="{'currency_field': 'currency_id'}"/>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
